    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "On the drive up today — 1500 miles from Milwaukee — I saw a pair of kids playing wiffle ball along the desert road. Baseball is everywhere. October baseball is everywhere. That includes in my ears now over the radio airwaves with this as the backdrop. Let’s have a World Series.",
      "likes": 26,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-10-24T00:10:32.346Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mylfqhkecs2n",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "今日ミルウォーキーから1500マイル走る道中、砂漠の道沿いでウィッフルボールをする子どもたちを見た。野球はどこにでもある。October baseballもどこにでもある。ラジオからもこの音が流れている。いいワールドシリーズにしよう。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "samdykstramilb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Sam Dykstra",
      "team": "全国",
      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "Fun fact: The Tacoby Bellsbury promotion led to suspensions on my high school’s football team because multiple kids skipped practice to get their free taco.",
      "likes": 21,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-10-24T00:57:34.497Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myliekxhak2u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "豆知識：Tacoby Bellsburyのプロモーションのせいで、私の母校のフットボール部では停部処分が出た。無料のタコスをもらうために、何人もが練習をサボったから。"
    },
